+# NUI v8 Implementation Plan
+
+1. Establish red tests for portable host adapters, external-skill trust, media opportunity/shape audits, rights ledgers, creative tool authority and completion blocking.
+2. Add deterministic `interop.py`, `media.py` and bounded `mcp_server.py` kernels plus CLI entry points.
+3. Add nine host adapters, tool-learning/media/creative registries and six typed schemas.
+4. Add eight unique decision-owner skills, canonical graph entries, v8 manifest and five bespoke depth anchors per owner; require exact 174-skill depth-lock coverage.
+5. Wire v8 routes into existing high-blast-radius owners instead of duplicating their responsibilities.
+6. Add four v8 eval planes with eight cases each and integrate all v8 files/metrics into repository validation.
+7. Upgrade README/USAGE/AGENTS, release packet and GitHub CI to v8.
+8. Run focused tests, full historical suite, repository validator, completion packet and diff hygiene; then integrate through exact-head PR CI and verify main artifacts independently.
